Package: lionfish
Title: Interactive 'tourr's using 'python'
Version: 1.0.4
Authors@R: 
    person("Matthias", "Medl", , "matthias.medl@chello.at", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3354-4579"))
Description: Extends the functionality of the 'tourr' package by an interactive
             graphical user interface. The interactivity allows users to
             effortlessly refine their 'tourr' results by manual intervention,
             which allows for integration of expert knowledge and aids the
             interpretation of results. For more information on 'tourr' see
             Wickham et. al (2011) <doi:10.18637/jss.v040.i02> or
             <https://github.com/ggobi/tourr>.
